SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5
    pe 4
    C(4) 0.5 mmol/kgw
    Mn 1 mmol/kgw
RATES
Calcite_user
-start
10 rate = PARM(1) * PARM(2)
20 moles = rate * TIME
30 SAVE moles
-end
KINETICS 1
    Calcite_user
        -formula Calcite 1
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -steps 1000 in 100
END
